[metadata] {"type": "create", "filePath": "/app/output/final_report.html", "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Air Jordan Sneaker Resale Market Analysis (2023–2026)</title>
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js@4.4.0/dist/chart.umd.min.js"></script>
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #0f1117;
    --surface: #1a1d27;
    --surface2: #22263a;
    --border: #2e3347;
    --accent: #e8573b;
    --accent2: #4c9be8;
    --accent3: #50c878;
    --accent4: #f0b429;
    --text: #e2e8f0;
    --text-muted: #8896b3;
    --text-dim: #5a6580;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  body {
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    min-height: 100vh;
  }
  .header {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1d27 0%, #12151f 100%);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 48px 40px 36px;
  }
  .header-meta {
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .header h1 {
    font-size: 30px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #fff;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .header p {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 14px;
    max-width: 700px;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
  .header-info {
    display: flex;
    gap: 24px;
    margin-top: 20px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .header-info span {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    background: var(--surface);
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  /* KPI Dashboard */
  .kpi-section {
    padding: 32px 40px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--bg);
  }
  .section-label {
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  .kpi-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .kpi-card {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 20px 20px 16px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .kpi-card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
    height: 2px;
  }
  .kpi-card.accent1::before { background: var(--accent); }
  .kpi-card.accent2::before { background: var(--accent2); }
  .kpi-card.accent3::before { background: var(--accent3); }
  .kpi-card.accent4::before { background: var(--accent4); }
  .kpi-card.accent5::before { background: #a78bfa; }
  .kpi-label {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .kpi-value {
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: #fff;
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .kpi-sub {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  /* Main content */
  .main {
    padding: 0 40px 60px;
    max-width: 1400px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .section {
    padding: 40px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .section:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .section-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }
  .section-number {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent);
    background: rgba(232,87,59,0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(232,87,59,0.2);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 2px 8px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    white-space: nowrap;
    margin-top: 3px;
  }
  .section h2 {
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #fff;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  .section h2 small {
    display: block;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-weight: 400;
    margin-top: 4px;
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }

  /* Charts */
  .chart-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .chart-grid-2 { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  .chart-grid-3 { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr; }
  .chart-wrap {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 20px;
  }
  .chart-title {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .chart-wrap canvas { display: block; }

  /* Tables */
  .table-wrap {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    overflow: hidden;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .table-wrap table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  .table-wrap thead tr {
    background: var(--surface2);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .table-wrap th {
    padding: 10px 14px;
    text-align: left;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.07em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-dim);
  }
  .table-wrap th.right, .table-wrap td.right { text-align: right; }
  .table-wrap td {
    padding: 9px 14px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .table-wrap tbody tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
  .table-wrap tbody tr:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02); }
  .pos { color: var(--accent3); font-weight: 600; }
  .neg { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 600; }
  .neu { color: var(--accent4); font-weight: 600; }

  /* Bars */
  .bar-wrap {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .bar-bg {
    flex: 1;
    height: 6px;
    background: var(--surface2);
    border-radius: 3px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .bar-fill {
    height: 100%;
    border-radius: 3px;
    transition: width 0.3s;
  }
  .bar-label { font-size: 12px; min-width: 50px; text-align: right; }

  /* Insight boxes */
  .insight-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-top: 20px;
  }
  .insight {
    background: var(--surface2);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent2);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 14px 16px;
  }
  .insight.green { border-left-color: var(--accent3); }
  .insight.amber { border-left-color: var(--accent4); }
  .insight.red { border-left-color: var(--accent); }
  .insight-title {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .insight p { font-size: 13px; color: var(--text); line-height: 1.55; }
  .insight strong { color: #fff; }

  /* Reco cards */
  .reco-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }
  .reco-card {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 20px;
  }
  .reco-number {
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--accent);
    opacity: 0.3;
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .reco-card h3 {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #fff;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .reco-card p {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.55;
  }
  .reco-card p strong { color: var(--text); }

  /* Condition comparison */
  .cond-compare {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .cond-card {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 20px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .cond-card h3 {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    padding-bottom: 12px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .cond-card.ds h3 { color: var(--accent3); }
  .cond-card.vnds h3 { color: var(--accent4); }
  .cond-card.used h3 { color: var(--accent); }
  .cond-stat { margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .cond-stat-val { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; }
  .cond-stat-lbl { font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-dim); margin-top: 2px; }
  .badge {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 2px 8px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    margin-top: 4px;
  }
  .badge.green { background: rgba(80,200,120,0.15); color: var(--accent3); }
  .badge.red { background: rgba(232,87,59,0.15); color: var(--accent); }
  .badge.amber { background: rgba(240,180,41,0.15); color: var(--accent4); }

  /* Channel velocity matrix */
  .velocity-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }
  .velocity-card {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 16px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .velocity-card h4 {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .velocity-stat { margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .velocity-stat .val { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; }
  .velocity-stat .lbl { font-size: 10px; color: var(--text-dim); }
  .speed-tag {
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 2px 8px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    margin-top: 8px;
    display: inline-block;
  }
  .speed-fast { background: rgba(80,200,120,0.15); color: var(--accent3); }
  .speed-slow { background: rgba(232,87,59,0.12); color: var(--accent); }

  /* Margin heat cell */
  .heatmap-table th { min-width: 70px; }

  /* Footer */
  footer {
    padding: 24px 40px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--surface);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
  }
  footer a { color: var(--accent2); text-decoration: none; }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .kpi-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    .chart-grid-2, .chart-grid-3, .reco-grid, .cond-compare, .velocity-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .header, .kpi-section, .main { padding-left: 20px; padding-right: 20px; }
    footer { flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- HEADER -->
<div class="header">
  <div class="header-meta">Market Analysis Report &mdash; Secondary Market Intelligence</div>
  <h1>Air Jordan Sneaker Resale Market Analysis</h1>
  <p>A comprehensive analysis of 5,000 secondary-market transactions examining pricing dynamics, profit margins, inventory velocity, and sales channel performance across Air Jordan models, colorways, and conditions from January 2023 to September 2025.</p>
  <div class="header-info">
    <span>Dataset: 5,000 Transactions</span>
    <span>Period: Jan 2023 – Sep 2025</span>
    <span>Models: 5 Silhouettes</span>
    <span>Channels: 5 Platforms</span>
    <span>Source: jordan_market_dataset_2026.csv</span>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- KPI DASHBOARD -->
<div class="kpi-section">
  <div class="section-label">Executive KPI Dashboard</div>
  <div class="kpi-grid">
    <div class="kpi-card accent1">
      <div class="kpi-label">Avg Profit Margin (USD)</div>
      <div class="kpi-value">$82.06</div>
      <div class="kpi-sub">Mean across all 5,000 transactions<br>Median: $35.30</div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi-card accent2">
      <div class="kpi-label">Resale Premium Rate</div>
      <div class="kpi-value">61.3%</div>
      <div class="kpi-sub">Share of transactions above retail<br>3,067 of 5,000 transactions</div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi-card accent3">
      <div class="kpi-label">Avg Days in Inventory</div>
      <div class="kpi-value">22.5</div>
      <div class="kpi-sub">Mean hold time before sale<br>Range: 1 – 60 days</div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi-card accent4">
      <div class="kpi-label">Resale-to-Retail Ratio</div>
      <div class="kpi-value">1.427×</div>
      <div class="kpi-sub">Mean resale / retail price<br>Avg retail: ~$191</div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi-card accent5">
      <div class="kpi-label">Top Colorway Avg Margin</div>
      <div class="kpi-value">$89.23</div>
      <div class="kpi-sub">Pine Green (all conditions)<br>566 transactions</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- MAIN CONTENT -->
<div class="main">

<!-- ─── SECTION 1: MARKET OVERVIEW ─── -->
<div class="section">
  <div class="section-header">
    <div class="section-number">01</div>
    <h2>Market Overview &amp; Transaction Summary
      <small>Price distribution, margin profile, and overall market structure across 5,000 recorded transactions</small>
    </h2>
  </div>

  <div class="chart-grid chart-grid-2">
    <div class="chart-wrap">
      <div class="chart-title">Profit Margin Distribution — All Transactions ($50 buckets)</div>
      <canvas id="marginHistogram" height="220"></canvas>
    </div>
    <div class="chart-wrap">
      <div class="chart-title">Retail vs. Resale Price by Condition</div>
      <canvas id="priceByCondition" height="220"></canvas>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="insight-grid">
    <div class="insight green">
      <div class="insight-title">Positive Margin Concentration</div>
      <p>The median margin of <strong>$35.30</strong> sits well below the mean of <strong>$82.06</strong>, indicating a right-skewed distribution. A minority of high-premium Deadstock transactions (avg $264 margin) substantially lift the mean, while the modal outcome for Used merchandise is a loss of ~$50–$100.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="insight red">
      <div class="insight-title">Below-Retail Exposure</div>
      <p><strong>38.7% of all transactions</strong> (1,933 of 5,000) cleared below the original MSRP. This concentration in used-condition inventory represents real capital risk: 847 transactions lost $50–$100 and 96 transactions lost more than $100, confirming that condition misjudgement at sourcing is the primary loss driver.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="insight amber">
      <div class="insight-title">Price Range &amp; Volatility</div>
      <p>Resale prices ranged from extreme lows near $65 (Used Jordan 1 Low) to peaks above $750 (Deadstock Jordan 11 Retro). Retail prices were relatively tight at <strong>$110–$230</strong>. This asymmetry means condition and colorway selection, not retail cost, determine final P&amp;L.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="insight">
      <div class="insight-title">Market Scale &amp; Coverage</div>
      <p>The dataset spans <strong>33 months</strong> (Jan 2023 – Sep 2025) across 5 silhouettes, 9 colorways, 3 condition tiers, and 5 sales channels — providing full-cycle coverage through market entry (2023), growth (2024), and continued expansion (2025). Transaction volumes are consistent, averaging ~153 records/month.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ─── SECTION 2: MODEL & COLORWAY ─── -->
<div class="section">
  <div class="section-header">
    <div class="section-number">02</div>
    <h2>Performance by Shoe Model &amp; Colorway
